#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:39 includes/class-px-catalog.php:45
#: includes/modules.php:282
msgid "Catalog mode"
msgstr "Katalógový režim"

#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:41
msgid ""
"Turn the shop into a browse-only catalog: add-to-cart buttons and the cart "
"are hidden. Useful for showrooms or price-on-request shops."
msgstr ""
"Zmení e-shop na katalóg len na prezeranie: tlačidlá do košíka a samotný "
"košík sú skryté. Vhodné pre showroomy alebo obchody s cenou na vyžiadanie."

#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:46
msgid "Enable catalog mode"
msgstr "Zapnúť katalógový režim"

#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:52
msgid "Prices"
msgstr "Ceny"

#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:53
msgid "Also hide prices"
msgstr "Skryť aj ceny"

#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:59
msgid "Replacement button text"
msgstr "Text náhradného tlačidla"

#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:60
msgid "Shown instead of \"Add to cart\". Empty falls back to \"View product\"."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazí sa namiesto „Pridať do košíka“. Prázdne použije „Zobraziť produkt“."

#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:66
msgid "Replacement button link"
msgstr "Odkaz náhradného tlačidla"

#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:67
msgid "Where the button points. Empty links to the product page."
msgstr "Kam tlačidlo smeruje. Prázdne odkazuje na stránku produktu."

#: includes/class-px-catalog.php:152
#: templates/emails/px-waitlist-in-stock.php:27
#: templates/emails/px-waitlist-subscribed.php:25
msgid "View product"
msgstr "Zobraziť produkt"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:145
msgid ""
"PX Shop Core: the \"Company details\" module is switched on, but WPify Woo "
"still handles IČO and DIČ. Turn off its \"IČ DIČ\" module (or deactivate the "
"plugin) and the fields will be served by PX Shop Core - the stored data is "
"the same and stays where it is."
msgstr ""
"PX Shop Core: modul „Firemné údaje“ je zapnutý, ale IČO a DIČ stále "
"obsluhuje WPify Woo. Vypnite jeho modul „IČ DIČ“ (alebo plugin deaktivujte) "
"a polia prevezme PX Shop Core — uložené údaje sú tie isté a zostávajú, kde "
"sú."

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:159
msgid "Checkout fields"
msgstr "Polia v pokladni"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:161
msgid ""
"IČO, DIČ and IČ DPH are stored as _billing_ic, _billing_dic and "
"_billing_dic_dph, the keys invoicing plugins and exports already expect. IČ "
"DPH is only shown for Slovak billing addresses; elsewhere the VAT id belongs "
"in DIČ. The company name field is part of the block even when WooCommerce is "
"set to hide it - an invoice needs a name, not just a number."
msgstr ""
"IČO, DIČ a IČ DPH sa ukladajú do kľúčov _billing_ic, _billing_dic a "
"_billing_dic_dph, teda tam, kde ich fakturačné pluginy a exporty už hľadajú. "
"IČ DPH sa zobrazuje len pri slovenskej fakturačnej adrese; inde patrí IČ DPH "
"do poľa DIČ. Pole s názvom firmy je súčasťou bloku aj vtedy, keď ho má "
"WooCommerce nastavené ako skryté — na faktúre treba meno, nielen číslo."

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:165
msgid "Company checkbox"
msgstr "Políčko „nakupujem na firmu“"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:166
msgid ""
"Show the \"I'm buying for a company\" checkbox and keep the fields hidden "
"until it is ticked"
msgstr ""
"Zobraziť políčko „Nakupujem na firmu“ a firemné polia ukázať až po jeho "
"zaškrtnutí"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:172
msgid "Field position"
msgstr "Umiestnenie polí"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:173
msgid "Keep the company block together right after the name"
msgstr "Držať firemný blok pohromade hneď za menom"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:177
msgid ""
"Name, then the checkbox, then the company name and the numbers - all above "
"the address, so the register lookup has somewhere to fill in. With this off "
"the block follows wherever the company field already sits."
msgstr ""
"Meno, potom políčko, potom názov firmy a čísla — všetko nad adresou, aby "
"malo načítanie z registra kam doplniť. Pri vypnutom ide blok tam, kde už "
"pole „Firma\" je."

#. translators: %s: field label
#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:180
#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:318
#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:763
msgid "Company name"
msgstr "Názov firmy"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:181
msgid "Required when buying for a company"
msgstr "Povinný pri nákupe na firmu"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:187
msgid "Identification number"
msgstr "IČO"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:188
msgid "When is IČO required?"
msgstr "Kedy je IČO povinné?"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:193
msgid "When the company checkbox is ticked"
msgstr "Keď je zaškrtnuté políčko „nakupujem na firmu“"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:194
msgid "When the company name is filled in"
msgstr "Keď je vyplnený názov firmy"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:195
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Nikdy"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:199
msgid "Format check"
msgstr "Kontrola formátu"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:200
msgid "Reject numbers that cannot be right before the order is placed"
msgstr ""
"Odmietnuť čísla, ktoré nemôžu byť správne, ešte pred odoslaním objednávky"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:204
msgid ""
"IČO 8 digits, SK DIČ 10 digits, SK IČ DPH SK + 10 digits, other EU VAT ids "
"country prefix + number."
msgstr ""
"IČO 8 číslic, SK DIČ 10 číslic, SK IČ DPH SK + 10 číslic, ostatné EÚ "
"predpona krajiny + číslo."

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:212
msgid "Public registers"
msgstr "Verejné registre"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:214
msgid ""
"RPO (Statistical Office) for Slovak numbers, ARES (Ministry of Finance) for "
"Czech ones. Both are free, need no key and are queried straight from the "
"shop; answers are cached for a week."
msgstr ""
"RPO (Štatistický úrad SR) pre slovenské čísla, ARES (MF ČR) pre české. Oboje "
"je zadarmo, bez kľúča a volá sa priamo z obchodu; odpovede sa kešujú na "
"týždeň."

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:218
msgid "Fill in from the register"
msgstr "Doplniť z registra"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:219
msgid "Offer a \"Load from register\" button next to IČO"
msgstr "Ponúknuť pri IČO tlačidlo „Načítať z registra“"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:223
msgid ""
"Fills the company name and registered address. The customer can still edit "
"everything afterwards."
msgstr "Doplní názov firmy a sídlo. Zákazník môže všetko potom upraviť."

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:226
msgid "Verify the number"
msgstr "Overiť číslo"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:227
msgid "Refuse an IČO the register does not know"
msgstr "Odmietnuť IČO, ktoré register nepozná"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:231
msgid ""
"Checked when the order is placed. If the register is down the order goes "
"through - the outage is ours to log, not the customer's to solve."
msgstr ""
"Kontroluje sa pri odoslaní objednávky. Keď register nefunguje, objednávka "
"prejde — výpadok je náš na zalogovanie, nie zákazníkov na riešenie."

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:239
msgid "VAT id verification (VIES)"
msgstr "Overenie IČ DPH (VIES)"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:241
msgid ""
"VIES is the European Commission register of VAT identification numbers. It "
"is the only evidence that a reverse-charge invoice was issued to a real VAT "
"payer, so keep it on wherever the reverse charge is on."
msgstr ""
"VIES je register identifikačných čísel pre DPH Európskej komisie. Je jediným "
"dokladom, že faktúra s prenesením daňovej povinnosti šla skutočnému "
"platiteľovi DPH — nechajte ho preto zapnutý všade, kde je zapnuté prenesenie."

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:245
msgid "VIES check"
msgstr "Kontrola vo VIES"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:250
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Vypnutá"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:251
msgid "Check and warn, let the order through"
msgstr "Overiť a upozorniť, objednávku pustiť"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:252
msgid "Check and refuse an unverified VAT id"
msgstr "Overiť a neoverené IČ DPH odmietnuť"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:254
msgid ""
"A VIES outage never blocks an order, not even in the strict setting - only "
"an answer saying the number is unknown does."
msgstr ""
"Výpadok VIES objednávku nezastaví nikdy, ani pri prísnom nastavení — zastaví "
"ju len odpoveď, že číslo neexistuje."

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:262
msgid "VAT exemption"
msgstr "Oslobodenie od DPH"

#: includes/class-px-company-fields.php:266
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Which country decides follows the WooCommerce setting <em>Calculate tax "
"based on</em> (%s): the shipping country for goods, the billing country for "
"services. Leave both switches off in a shop that sells at home only."
msgstr ""
