"uses - each one adds a row to the banner, to the cookie policy page and, "
"where it applies, a script to the page. Known limit: without IAB TCF "
"certification this banner is not enough for AdSense or Ad Manager; GA4 and "
"Ads conversion measurement are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Vlastná cookie lišta obchodu. Zapnite len služby, ktoré web naozaj používa — "
