#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-page.php:59
#: templates/consent/banner.php:56 templates/consent/modal.php:42
msgid "Cookie policy"
msgstr "Zásady používania cookies"

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-page.php:87
msgid ""
"Cookies are small files that a website stores in your browser. Some are "
"needed for the shop to work at all - without them the cart would forget what "
"you put in it. Others are only used with your consent: they measure how the "
"site is used or make our advertising more relevant."
msgstr ""
"Cookies sú malé súbory, ktoré si web ukladá vo vašom prehliadači. Niektoré "
"sú potrebné na to, aby obchod vôbec fungoval — bez nich by košík zabudol, čo "
"ste doň vložili. Ostatné používame len s vaším súhlasom: merajú, ako sa web "
"používa, alebo robia našu reklamu zmysluplnejšou."

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-page.php:88
msgid ""
"You decide about the optional ones when you first arrive and you can change "
"your mind at any time - the button at the end of this page opens the "
"settings again. Withdrawing consent is as easy as giving it and does not "
"affect what happened before."
msgstr ""
"O tých voliteľných rozhodujete pri prvej návšteve a kedykoľvek to môžete "
"zmeniť — tlačidlo na konci tejto stránky otvorí nastavenia znova. Odvolanie "
"súhlasu je rovnako jednoduché ako jeho udelenie a netýka sa toho, čo sa "
"stalo predtým."

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-page.php:89
msgid ""
"You also have the right to access your data, to have it corrected or erased, "
"to restrict or object to its processing and to lodge a complaint with the "
"supervisory authority. Details are in the privacy policy."
msgstr ""
"Máte tiež právo na prístup k svojim údajom, na ich opravu či vymazanie, na "
"obmedzenie spracúvania, právo namietať a podať sťažnosť dozornému orgánu. "
"Podrobnosti nájdete v zásadách ochrany osobných údajov."

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-services.php:71
msgid "Necessary"
msgstr "Nevyhnutné"

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-services.php:72
msgid ""
"Needed for the site to work - the cart, logging in, remembering the choice "
"you are making right now. They cannot be switched off."
msgstr ""
"Potrebné na fungovanie webu — košík, prihlásenie, zapamätanie voľby, ktorú "
"práve robíte. Nedajú sa vypnúť."

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-services.php:76
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Preferencie"

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-services.php:77
msgid ""
"Remember your settings, such as the language or the way products are listed, "
"so you do not have to choose again."
msgstr ""
"Zapamätajú si vaše nastavenia, napríklad jazyk alebo spôsob výpisu "
"produktov, aby ste ich nemuseli voliť znova."

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-services.php:81
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Štatistika"

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-services.php:82
msgid ""
"Tell us how the site is used - which pages are visited and where visitors "
"get lost. The data is used to improve the shop."
msgstr ""
"Hovoria nám, ako sa web používa — ktoré stránky ľudia navštevujú a kde sa "
"strácajú. Údaje slúžia na zlepšovanie obchodu."

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-services.php:86
msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "Marketing"

#: includes/consent/class-px-consent-services.php:87
msgid ""
"Used to measure the results of advertising and to show you offers that are "
"relevant to you, here and on other sites."
msgstr ""
"Slúžia na meranie výsledkov reklamy a na to, aby sme vám tu aj inde "
"ukazovali ponuky, ktoré vás môžu zaujímať."

